        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Note: The unnatural (credit) balance in the Power Purchased for Storage Operations account is driven by purchased energy associated with storage operations. SPS began storage operations in April 2026. In accordance with FERC Order No. 898, purchased energy associated with storage operations is recorded in Account 555.1. The total amount in this account is the purchase power for battery operations that was included in RTO/ISO settlement statements which are presented in FERC 555 on page 397.</span>
